# REUSE.toml or LICENSES/. Adoption recognises its own rendering by digest and
# refreshes only a file it recognises, so a formatter rewrite (one space before
# the two version comments) would freeze it at today's text.
.github/workflows/reuse.yml

# The HISS-20 fixture corpus is input to the rules, not source governed by them,
